        ["What would you like to say?"] = "¿Qué te gustaría decir?",
        ["What are you doing?"] = "¿Qué estás haciendo?",
        ["I used to roam the lands robbing travellers and giving the loot to anyone I liked. It was such a happy life, and I didn't really do much harm."] = "Solía vagar por las tierras robando a los viajeros y dándole el botín a quien quisiera. Era una vida muy feliz y realmente no hice mucho daño.",
        ["Suddenly they've decided that wealth redistribution is a crime, so they've stuck me in here with a stupid mugger. We even have to take turns using the bed!"] = "De repente decidieron que la redistribución de la riqueza es un delito, así que me encerraron aquí con un estúpido atracador. ¡Incluso tenemos que turnarnos para usar la cama!",
        ["I still shout 'Stand and deliver' at people, but it doesn't really work so well from in here."] = "Todavía le grito a la gente 'Stand and Delivery', pero en realidad no funciona tan bien desde aquí.",
        ["That's really sad."] = "Eso es realmente triste.",
        ["You could cheer me up by shooting the mugger. I like it when people shoot the mugger. I like it when people shoot the mugger, even though he always comes back."] = "Podrías animarme disparándole al atracador. Me gusta cuando la gente dispara al atracador. Me gusta cuando la gente dispara al atracador, aunque siempre regresa.",
        ["Hahaha, you're locked up."] = "Jajaja, estás encerrado.",
